>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-See · Plane einen vollen Tag ein. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/de/guide/seoul/#o13</description><Point><coordinates>126.9965,37.28763,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
